    "name": "Liquity Protocol V1 Supply V2 Protocol Stats API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Liquity static JSON API at api.liquity.org covers circulating supplies, protocol stats, stability pool data, prices, governance epochs, yield opportunities, borrow rates, and a points leaderboard. Data is generated on-chain and published as flat files to GitHub Pages. Liquity V1 issues LUSD stablecoin backed by ETH. Liquity V2 (BOLD) supports multi-collateral borrowing with WETH, wstETH, and rETH.\n\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Liquity Team",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
